### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Upload valid partner batch (includes admin1)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="schools_partner_batch_01.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./data/schools_partner_batch_01.csv
------Boundary--

### Upload bad partner batch (admin1 column removed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="schools_partner_batch_01_bad.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./data/schools_partner_batch_01_bad.csv
------Boundary--
